        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+2 greater striking keen khopesh</em> is crafted from a nearly flawless reflective material, making its surfaces glimmer with a mesmerizing shine.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Mirage Guard</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You wave the mirrorblade around your head to create illusory distortions around you, making it difficult for opponents to judge your true position. For the next 10 minutes, you aren't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to melee attacks from creatures flanking you.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Scryshield</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The mirrorblade's reflective surface dulls, and you and all your possessions are surrounded by a shimmering field that makes you invisible to scrying magic for 1 hour. In addition, you also learn about any scrying effects within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] (as detect scrying). If you sheathe, drop, or attack with the <em>mirrorblade</em>, this effect ends early.</p>"
        },
